   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "PROBLEM / TRADE-OFF\nThere is no universal optimum: quality <-> KV memory <-> bandwidth <-> latency\n(an architecture-search problem).  Pick g from the budget, not from theory.",
   "originalText": "PROBLEM / TRADE-OFF\nThere is no universal optimum: quality <-> KV memory <-> bandwidth <-> latency\n(an architecture-search problem).  Pick g from the budget, not from theory.",
