   "text": "KV1 (shared in group)\nK1 : (T,128)\nV1 : (T,128)",
   "originalText": "KV1 (shared in group)\nK1 : (T,128)\nV1 : (T,128)",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "e260",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "e262",
   "type": "rectangle",
   "x": 700,
   "y": 1129.5,
   "width": 901.0,
   "height": 157.5,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "#f1f3f5",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": {
    "type": 3
   },
   "seed": 1195022320,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 132618470,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "id": "e263"
    }
   ],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false
  },
  {
   "id": "e263",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 710,
   "y": 1144.5,
   "width": 871.0,
   "height": 127.5,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 700041331,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1465295449,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "For Q head i (1-indexed), g = H_q / H_kv = 4:\n  kv(i) = floor((i-1)/g) + 1      Q1..Q4 -> KV1,  Q5..Q8 -> KV2, ..., Q29..Q32 -> KV8\n  O_i   = softmax( Q_i K_kv(i)^T / sqrt(128) ) V_kv(i)\n  Q_i : (1,128)   K_kv(i) : (T,128)   V_kv(i) : (T,128)   O_i : (1,128)\n  concat 32 heads : (1, 32x128) = (1,4096)   then  x W_o (4096x4096) -> (1,4096)\n  boundaries:  g = 1 -> MHA (kv(i) = i)      g = H_q -> MQA (kv(i) = 1)",
   "originalText": "For Q head i (1-indexed), g = H_q / H_kv = 4:\n  kv(i) = floor((i-1)/g) + 1      Q1..Q4 -> KV1,  Q5..Q8 -> KV2, ..., Q29..Q32 -> KV8\n  O_i   = softmax( Q_i K_kv(i)^T / sqrt(128) ) V_kv(i)\n  Q_i : (1,128)   K_kv(i) : (T,128)   V_kv(i) : (T,128)   O_i : (1,128)\n  concat 32 heads : (1, 32x128) = (1,4096)   then  x W_o (4096x4096) -> (1,4096)\n  boundaries:  g = 1 -> MHA (kv(i) = i)      g = H_q -> MQA (kv(i) = 1)",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "e262",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "e264",
   "type": "rectangle",
   "x": 700,
   "y": 1307.0,
   "width": 697.3000000000001,
   "height": 120.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
