   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "KEY INSIGHT\nOnly W_k, W_v shrink: 4096x4096 -> 4096x1024 (4x).\nParams saved: 2 x (16.78M - 4.19M) = 25.2M per layer.\nd_h = 4096/32 = 128 unchanged; Q and W_o untouched.\nQuery head i reads K/V head  i // g  (0-indexed).",
   "originalText": "KEY INSIGHT\nOnly W_k, W_v shrink: 4096x4096 -> 4096x1024 (4x).\nParams saved: 2 x (16.78M - 4.19M) = 25.2M per layer.\nd_h = 4096/32 = 128 unchanged; Q and W_o untouched.\nQuery head i reads K/V head  i // g  (0-indexed).",
   "fontSize": 18,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "e315",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
