   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "one layer, one decode token, S = 2\nFLOPs = 4 . H_q . d_h . T     (QK^T + PV)\nBytes = 2 . H_kv . d_h . T . S = 4 . H_kv . d_h . T\nAI    = H_q / H_kv = g   FLOP/B\nbytes/token/layer, T=100K toy: 2*8*64*1e5*2 = 204.8 MB\n(MHA 819 MB, MQA 25.6 MB); x32 layers = 6.55 GB",
   "originalText": "one layer, one decode token, S = 2\nFLOPs = 4 . H_q . d_h . T     (QK^T + PV)\nBytes = 2 . H_kv . d_h . T . S = 4 . H_kv . d_h . T\nAI    = H_q / H_kv = g   FLOP/B\nbytes/token/layer, T=100K toy: 2*8*64*1e5*2 = 204.8 MB\n(MHA 819 MB, MQA 25.6 MB); x32 layers = 6.55 GB",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 3,
