  {
   "id": "e516",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 770,
   "y": 4397.0,
   "width": 617.8000000000001,
   "height": 135.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 427886183,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 669316237,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "KEY INSIGHT\nMean-pooling keeps the information of every original head\n(unlike dropping heads), so the checkpoint starts close to its\nold function and recovers quality in a short uptraining run.\nGQA paper: mean pooling > picking one head > random init.\nUptrained GQA-8 ~ MHA quality at ~MQA speed.",
   "originalText": "KEY INSIGHT\nMean-pooling keeps the information of every original head\n(unlike dropping heads), so the checkpoint starts close to its\nold function and recovers quality in a short uptraining run.\nGQA paper: mean pooling > picking one head > random init.\nUptrained GQA-8 ~ MHA quality at ~MQA speed.",
   "fontSize": 18,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "e515",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "e517",
   "type": "rectangle",
   "x": 760,
   "y": 4563.0,
   "width": 855.7,
   "height": 120.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": {
    "type": 3
   },
   "seed": 2100509031,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 184370611,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "id": "e518"
    }
   ],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false
  },
  {
   "id": "e518",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 770,
   "y": 4578.0,
   "width": 825.7,
   "height": 90.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 2010590888,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1015642022,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "PROBLEM / TRADE-OFF\nStill needs a (small) training run and the same data/recipe discipline.\nCheaper than MHA -> MLA (low-rank factorisation + RoPE restructuring).\nMean-pooling all 32 heads gives an MQA init, but uptrained MQA is worse than GQA-8.",
   "originalText": "PROBLEM / TRADE-OFF\nStill needs a (small) training run and the same data/recipe discipline.\nCheaper than MHA -> MLA (low-rank factorisation + RoPE restructuring).\nMean-pooling all 32 heads gives an MQA init, but uptrained MQA is worse than GQA-8.",
   "fontSize": 18,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "e517",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "e519",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 4723.0,
   "width": 1051.2,
   "height": 35.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 37590537,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 621887389,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "8  Choosing the ratio: quality vs cache, and what real models picked",
   "originalText": "8  Choosing the ratio: quality vs cache, and what real models picked",
   "fontSize": 28,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
