   "locked": false
  },
  {
   "id": "e564",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 10,
   "y": 5396.0,
   "width": 1526.8,
   "height": 112.5,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 103654957,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 602664893,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "1. GQA: H_q Q heads, H_kv K/V heads, group size g = H_q/H_kv; Q head i reads K/V head i // g.  g=1 is MHA, g=H_q is MQA.\n2. Shapes: W_k, W_v 4096 x (H_kv*128); K, V cache (B, H_kv, T, 128); grouped scores (B, H_kv, g, T); output (B, 1, 4096).\n3. Memory and bytes/token drop by g: toy 256 KiB -> 64 KiB/token (26.2 -> 6.55 GB at 100K); Llama-3-8B 512 -> 128 KiB/token (8K: 4 -> 1 GiB).\n4. AI = g = 4 for GQA-8: 4x better than MHA but still ~50x below the A100 ridge (~200): decode stays memory-bound.\n5. A100 40 GB with 14 GB weights: MHA @100K = 40.2 GB (OOM), GQA-8 = 20.55 GB.   Retrofit: mean-pool K/V heads, ~5% extra compute.",
   "originalText": "1. GQA: H_q Q heads, H_kv K/V heads, group size g = H_q/H_kv; Q head i reads K/V head i // g.  g=1 is MHA, g=H_q is MQA.\n2. Shapes: W_k, W_v 4096 x (H_kv*128); K, V cache (B, H_kv, T, 128); grouped scores (B, H_kv, g, T); output (B, 1, 4096).\n3. Memory and bytes/token drop by g: toy 256 KiB -> 64 KiB/token (26.2 -> 6.55 GB at 100K); Llama-3-8B 512 -> 128 KiB/token (8K: 4 -> 1 GiB).\n4. AI = g = 4 for GQA-8: 4x better than MHA but still ~50x below the A100 ridge (~200): decode stays memory-bound.\n5. A100 40 GB with 14 GB weights: MHA @100K = 40.2 GB (OOM), GQA-8 = 20.55 GB.   Retrofit: mean-pool K/V heads, ~5% extra compute.",
   "fontSize": 18,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "e563",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "e565",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 5543.5,
   "width": 1654.5891625615761,
   "height": 20.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#868e96",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 218420257,
   "version": 2,
   "versionNonce": 110847767,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Sources: Ainslie et al. 2023, GQA (arXiv 2305.13245);  Shazeer 2019, MQA (arXiv 1911.02150); GPU ridge points: A100 312 TFLOPS / 1.555 TB/s, H100 SXM 989 TFLOPS / 3.35 TB/s",
   "originalText": "Sources: Ainslie et al. 2023, GQA (arXiv 2305.13245);  Shazeer 2019, MQA (arXiv 1911.02150); GPU ridge points: A100 312 TFLOPS / 1.555 TB/s, H100 SXM 989 TFLOPS / 3.35 TB/s",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "t3_1",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 0,
