   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Llama-3-8B shape (L = 32, H_Q = 32, H_kv = 8, d_h = 128). KiB per token, all layers. Bars to scale (1 px = 0.25 KiB). Full map: Beyond → KV cache SOTA map.",
   "originalText": "Llama-3-8B shape (L = 32, H_Q = 32, H_kv = 8, d_h = 128). KiB per token, all layers. Bars to scale (1 px = 0.25 KiB). Full map: Beyond → KV cache SOTA map.",
